      "message_parsed": "Спасибо.Но там чють по другому.<br />\n<span style=\"color: #000000\"><span style=\"color: #0000bb\">$page_cfg</span><span style=\"color: #007700\">[</span><span style=\"color: #dd0000\">&#039;show_sidebar2&#039;</span><span style=\"color: #007700\">] = array(</span><span style=\"color: #ff8000\"># BB_SCRIPT =&gt; true</span><span style=\"color: #dd0000\">&#039;index&#039; </span><span style=\"color: #007700\">=&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #0000bb\">false</span><span style=\"color: #007700\">,</span></span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #007700\">);</span><br />\n <br />\nМеняем <span style=\"color: #000000\"><span style=\"color: #dd0000\">&#039;index&#039; </span><span style=\"color: #007700\">=&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #0000bb\">false</span><span style=\"color: #007700\">, </span></span>на <span style=\"color: #000000\"><span style=\"color: #dd0000\">&#039;index&#039; </span><span style=\"color: #007700\">=&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #0000bb\">true</span><span style=\"color: #007700\">,</span></span><br />\n <br />\nИдем в <span style=\"color: #000000\">misc/html. И ищем </span><span style=\"color: #000000\">sidebar2.html</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #000000\">Туда и вписываем нужный код оформления.🙂 </span>",
